<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Filip</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl nakwyal bot ɛ ghaada Filip ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filip</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl nakwyal bot ɛ ghaada</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filip ɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl nakus zɛɛga mendjaala kɔ ghaada Filip ɛ́, é mɛdjoŋ mɛ ebá yii ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Yɛ ɛ́ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛkɛn Pɔl nakus kɔ kyee dik Elɔp ɛ. Ghaada Filip ɛ́ pɛ ɛko ɛ dik nɛ pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo ɛ kyee dik Ghɛlɛs, tɔ kyee dik Masedwan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl pɛ daa ekeletyɛ e ghaada Filip lyaal ɛ́ tɛtɛ ɛgwakel nyɛ di nɛ yɛ pak bɛ nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɛ. É sok nyɛ nadi ekwyal mɛkana mɛ tak ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ é membok. Étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nadi nɛ mezuk tɔ lyem, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyee bɛ. Pɔl ɛpekwyɛl ɛdjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz, étɛp bɛ neepyet tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek, nyɛ ɛpelɛɛ bɛ kwyɛl nyɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. Nyɛ ɛpebaabem ba kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot ɛpegoola bhaadal ɛ Klisto étɛp bɛ ɛ́ nɛ mbee esiiza di epus bɛ náá, bɛ kɔk kɔ lɔɔ ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:15-17">1.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:21">2.21</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:2">3.2</ref>,<ref loc="PHP 3:18">18</ref></char>). Pɔl ɛpegek ɛkyeed bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ di egyee tɔ mɛsa ɔ pɛ ghaada Filip. Nyɛ nagek deenek ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neekɛkwyee bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala, da bɛ ɛ́ bula nɛ menduk mɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2.19-30</ref></char>). Pɛ yɔbɔ kyee, bot ɛ ghaada Filip naakyeed mɛtom pɛ daa Pɔl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4.10-20</ref></char>). Tɔ mɛkana Pɔl nakyeed pɛ daa bot ɛ ghaada Filip ɛ, nyɛ naaghaapɛɛ bɛ. Nyɛ naadjɛ bɛ pe mɛlyo, étɛp bɛ neebela mɛghaaz kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl eelyaal bot ɛ ghaada Filip etɛp ee di dum nɛ <char style="em">tsik nɛ ɛsyee ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:6-11">2.6-11</ref></char>). Yezu naabet ekum nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ pɛ daa Sɛɛg ɛ. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, Zɛɛb nadjɛ nyɛ di ekukuma kɔ bot djas nɛ kɔ esonok djas. Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa Pɔl nalum koŋ nɛ eboo bot ɛ nyɛ nadi egu pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:3-10">3.3-10</ref></char>). Deenek, nyɛ naamyaal ɛzuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto, batakɛkum tɔ membok. Nyɛ eemyam ɛdjɛ ɛ́ tsik'ɛ met kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Yezu. Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, nyɛ waagom dhiiti dwoo pak myoŋ. Nyɛ ɛpelyo bot ɛ Filip náá, bɛ du geka yɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:17">3.17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:9">4.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ mɛkana mɛ djas, Pɔl nadi emyaala nɛ sa ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb di edjɛ nyɛ ɛ. Nyɛ ɛpedjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ bot ɛ Filip náá, bɛ <char style="em">di tɔ mɛmyaala</char>. Mɛmyaala menek goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi tak ye nakoozodi tɔ mɛtsak, nɛ tɔ mezuk, é ghɛŋ ekeletyɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel pak'ɔɔ, nɛ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Pɔl nɛ Timote, bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Yezu Klisto. Bis kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ́, étɛp bot ɛ di mos bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto pɛ ghaada Filip ɔ dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di edjɛɛd zɛɛga mendjaala ɔ, zɛnɔɔ edhyakɛlɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena nɛ Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'enaka djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpebulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Mɛ nɛ bulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb'am é mɛwala djas mɛ di etaala bin ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Mɛ nɛ dyeebamyaala é mɛwala djas mɛ di edjaala étɛp'en ɛ, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛkwyeea mɛ bi nakwyee mɛ tɔ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, kana dwoo bi nakan ɛmyaal Zɛɛb ɛ, kɛkum dwoo pan mos'ak. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Tin, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, Zɛɛb mot nakan embɛɛ mɛsa mak pak'en ɔ, nyɛ aatɔ́ nɛ yɛ kɛkum ɛsik ɛ tak, dwoo ɛbula ɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ gham nɛ ɛdi nɛ esiiza binek nɛ nen, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ wa bin tɔ lyem'am. Etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas ɛ́ sama nɛ nam tɔ ɛkɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ mɛ ɛ. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bi ɛ́ sama nɛ nam ye nakoozodi, dáa mɛ di nenak é membok'aak nɛghu é sok mɛ di elyaal nɛ bot náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ di egoola ɛ yɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Zɛɛb ɛ́ tyaases'am, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl biyɔ djas, dáa Yezu Klisto di ekwyɛl bin ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Gwakeka sa mɛ di ewaab nɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mendjaala mam ɛ: Yɛ ɛ́ náá, bi di nɛ mɛkwyɛla pak'en dhaa tyɛ. Da bi ɛ́ di bot ɛ ɛtiibal nɛ bot ɛ ɛgu etɛp ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />Deenek ɛ, bi aapiibal sa di ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ. Tin, bi aadi ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ edhuud, ààbɛ nɛ sa ɛbiyo wat dwoo Klisto aazyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Beta náá, bi di nɛ mɛsa mɛ epiki ɛbuɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto, étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ duma.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛpegoolaaa djala dik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ bi gu náá, sa mɛ naboma nɛ yɛ ɛ, ye naasa náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal goolaaa djala dik. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Deenek, esodja ee di ebaal ndjaa boo kukuma ɔ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot djas ɔ, nɛ kagu nenak náá, mɛ ɛ́ é membok ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Dáa bɔn-nyɛɛg bis nabee mɛ é membok ɛ, bɛtɛ nɛ bot pak'ɔɔ naazɛwa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Ghɛŋ, bɔɔ batabela mɛghaaz mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zɛɛb, ààbɛ nɛ bwoo.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot pak'ɔɔ ɛpegoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto nɛ mbee lyem. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ embee egeka nɛ nam. Tin, bɛdhiiti bɔn-nyɛɛg goola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛ́ nɛ mbɛɛ lyem. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Bot ɛ di egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɔ, bɛ goola yɛ ɛ́ nɛ kwyɛl djas. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ gu náá, mɛsa mam wak ɛ́ ɛlyaal bot náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ di goola ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bot goola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛ́ nɛ mbee lyem. Ɛkwosak ɛ lɔɔ ɛ́ ɛpul, bɛ saŋ ɛ náá, bɛ baabil mezuk mam tɔ membok.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ye nakoozodi náá, egeka bɔɔ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe nɛghu ɛbiyoɛpe ɔ, sa di enyɔ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛpegoolaaa. Deenek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala, mɛ aazodidi ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ gu náá, etɛp binek djas lyaal ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waatsik mɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mendjaala men nɛ ghwyil Sisim ɛ Yezu Klisto di ekwyee mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Tin, sa mɛ di ebwood ɛ́, yii mɛ di nɛ boo ɛbwaalel ɛ, mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi nɛ sen. Mos, mɛ nakoozogwyɛ, mɛ nakoozodi nɛ tsik, mɛ aazodi elyaal duma ɛ Klisto é edi djas mɛ aadi ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ bɛ mam ɔɔ, Klisto ɛ́ di tsik'am. É di'enek, ɛsyee moo ɛ́ mbɛɛ sa. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, ɛdi nɛ tsik kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛpesa náá, mɛ sa enɛm esa ɔɔ, é di'enek, mɛ ààgu sa mɛ aasɛ́ɛ pak ɛsyee nɛ tsik ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Mɛ moo ɛ́ pak bɛman, mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛbet tsik mɛ di nɛ yɛ'aak, étɛp mɛ needi sama nɛ Klisto, deenek ɛ́ di ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nam. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Tin, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ len náá, mɛ zodi nɛ tsik. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Dáa mɛ di nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ tsik dáak ɛ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, mɛ aadidi ɛ́ sama nɛ nen, étɛp mɛ needjɛ bin mɛghaaz mɛ ɛtɔ́ sok, nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ mɛ aabula zɛdi pak'en ɛ, bi aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ sa Yezu Klisto sa nɛ nam ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkɛ dáa Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto di elɛɛ ɛ. Tin, mɛ zyɛ zɛbee bin nɛghu mɛ di ààzyɛ ɔɔ, ye nyɔ ɛ́, mɛ gwak náá, bi ɛ́ ghiŋ tɔ sisim wat. Ye nyɔ ɛ́ mɛ gwak náá, bi ɛpepyet nɛ lyem wat étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Sa bi ààgwak bwoo bot ɛ mɛbhuka men. Yɛ aadi nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ ndem di elyaal náá, bɛ eezewo ze, biyɔ ɛ́ kazebela tsik ɛ. Tin, etɛp binek djas dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naadjɛ bin mbɛɛ bhwoob ɛsa mɛsa ɛ Klisto, ààkabɛ náá, ee zosikɛ é ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ nɛ, yɛ ɛ́ pe ɛ́ étɛp ɛdi tɔ mezuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Mena ɛpeduuka tuub wat. Bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, é ghɛŋ sok mɛ nadi eduu tuub tak, nenak, mɛ baazoduu ɛ́ tuub tak wat.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Klisto moo ɛ́ mot-mɛsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Klisto nɛ djɛ bin mɛghaaz é? Bi ààbela mɛghaaz tɔ kwyɛl ɛ Klisto? Bi ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ? Bi ɛ́ nɛ kwyɛl nɛ lyem ghoŋ nɛ bɔn bɛsɔ bin é? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, saka náá, mɛ di tɔ mɛmyaala é mɛwala djas. Dika tɔ ɛgwakel pak'en. Betka náá, elyem bin di nɛ esiiza wat, dika nɛ lyem wat tɔ esa djas bi di ekwyɛl ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Sa bi ààsa dhiiti sonok nɛ lyem zok, sa bi ààsaa náá, bot duwal min men. Tin, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛsila, beeka náá, bɔɔ bɛsɔ bin eedhaa bin. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Deenek, sa mot ààzokwyɛɛg nyel'ɛ nɛ nyel'ɛ met, ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, nyɛ kwyɛɛg bɛsɔ bot. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Dika nɛ embɛɛ mɛfulu dáa Yezu Klisto nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Yezu mot di tyee wat nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛben ɛ nyel kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Ààbɛ, nyɛy ɛmet naabyen esa djas nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">étɛp ɛdi mot-mɛsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Nyɛ nakadi ɛ́ mot pak bot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Nyɛ nabyel ɛ́ mot nɛ nyel epuud dáa bot djas.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Nyɛ naamyaal ɛdi tɔ mɛsila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">Nyɛ naalyaal ɛlooba ɛ lɛ kɛkum dwoo ɛsyee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">ɛsyee ɛ nyɛ nagwyɛ mbema kɔ mɛlaaba ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ Zɛɛb naben nyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">Nyɛ naadjɛ nyɛ di di edhaa edi djas ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">nyɛ naadjɛ nyɛ din,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">yɛ ɛ́ din ɛ di kɔ min djas ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Nyɛ eesa náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">bot djas tɔ gwoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">kɔ bɔs zɛnɔɔ si bɔs,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">pyak mɛboŋ mɔɔ si,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">étɛp ɛduwal din ɛ Yezu.<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />Nyɛ eesa náá, membyak djas djɛ duma nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg é ɛke náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">«Yɛ ɛ́ Yezu Klisto ɛ di Ghɛŋ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Eza 45.23</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaska dáa mengel kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, bi nadi elooba nɛ nam é sok mɛ nadi pak'en ɛ. Deenek, dáa mɛ kadi mos ààbɛ pak'en ɛ, gheeleloobaka nɛ nam dhaa dáa bi di boozezyɛ nɛ ɛsa, mam pak'en ɛ. Deenek, waka zii tɔ mɛsa, étɛp ɛlyaal náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ tsik, da bi ɛ́ lyaal náá, bi nɛ kaab Zɛɛb ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet ɛ di edjɛ bin ghwyil, étɛp bi neekwyɛl ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ nɛ ɛsa yɛ dáa nyɛ ɛmet di ekwyɛl ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Saka mɛsa djas, ààlɛka, ààwaya, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />étɛp bi needi ààliiaa nɛ yɛ ɛbiyoɛpe, bi needi bot ɛ epiki. Bi needi bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ tɔ sama bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ ɛbiyo kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak. Deenek, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkas tɔ lɔɔ ɛ́, dáa ekwyikwyen tɔ gwoo, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgoola bɛ mɛkpa mɛ tsik. É di'enek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛmyaala nɛ nen dwoo Klisto aabula ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛsa mam nɛ mezuk mam nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ yii toto. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Yɛ kobɛ náá, ghiya yam eesee étɛp ɛkala kɔ buwa bi di edjɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len ɔɔ, yɛ sael deenek ɔɔ, mɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala, mɛ waasa náá, menabɛlka djas di tɔ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ biyɔ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛmyaala, da bi ɛ́ wa mɛ tɔ mɛmyaala men.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eelwom Timote bɛ nɛ Epafolodhit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ mɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ, mɛ bee ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ náá, mɛ moo aadhis Timote pɛ daa lin. Etɛɛ náá, é sok nyɛ aadjɛ mɛ menduk men ɛ, mɛ aabela mɛghaaz. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ zodi ekɛm mɛ tɔ etɛp bam. Nyɛy ɛ di etaala bin nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ tyee wat nɛ nam. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bot dyeebaawa lyem ɛ́ é etɛp bɔɔ met, bɛ ààwa lyem é etɛp ɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu dáa Timote nalyaal esosoob bɛ, dáa mɔn di egoka ɛsa nɛ sɛɛg ɛ. Nyɛ naazɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mɛ waadhis bin nwyak, é sok mɛ aabee náá, etɛp bam moo ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ghɛŋ, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mɛ moo aazyɛ zɛbee bin.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />É di'enek, mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe náá, mɛ bulal bin mɔn-nyɛɛg'ena Epafolodhit. Nyɛ ɛ́ mot di egyee bis nɛ nɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ Klisto ɔ, mot bis nɛ nɛ di eduu tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɔ, mot bi nadhis mɛ nwyak étɛp nyɛ neezɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ mɛ nadi esa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛbaabee biyɔ djas. Deenek, nyɛ naadyeebatuŋ, é sok nyɛ nagu náá, bi naagwak náá, nyɛ nadi ebɛ́ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Nyɛ naadyeebabɛ́, kunaa-kunaak nɛ ɛsyee. Tin, Zɛɛb naagek nyɛ ghoŋ, ààkoobɛ nɛ nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet, yɛ ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ mam, étɛp mɛ needi ààbaadi nɛ boo ghoŋ tɔ lyem. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ mɛ di edhis bin nwyak ghaal-ghaal, étɛp bi neemyaala é sok bi aaboma ɛ. Étɛp mɛ needi ààbaadi nɛ ghoŋ tɔ lyem. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Deenek, myaalka nyɛ nɛ boo mɛmyaala djas, dáa mɔn-nyɛɛg'en tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlyaal mbi mot dáa nyɛy kwyɛl, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naawaagwyɛ étɛp mɛsa mɛ Klisto. Nyɛ naaka nyel étɛp ɛzɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ bi nadi ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛzɛkwyee mɛ biyɔ bɛmet ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl eewa ɛbwaalel nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Nenak, bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, dika nɛ mɛmyaala tɔ ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Ghɛŋ. Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ ɛpebasal ɛlɛɛ bin sa mɛ nazekwyal ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛdjɛ bin mɛghaaz. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Dika ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ bot ɛ di esa ɛbiyo ɔ, bot ɛ di dáa bɛbhyɛ ɔ, bɛ bee beka ɛ́ dáa boo sonok! <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ghuna, yɛ ɛ́ menabɛlka ɛ́ di nɛ tɛtɛ beka, etɛɛ náá, mena ɛpesaka mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb tɔ Sisim yɛ. Menaka ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala étɛp ɛdi ɛ́ sama nɛ Yezu Klisto. Mena ààwaka ɛbwaalel ɛ lena kɔ mɛzel mɛ bot ɛ bɔs di esa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Mam pe ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdiig bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ membi mɛ mɛzel mɛ bot ɛ bɔs di esa ɛ. Mɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ boo gham ɛsa yɛ dhaa bɔɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Mɛ naniigelaa beka ɛ́, mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl bhis ɛbyel ɛ lam. Mɛ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Yisalaɛl, mot mbyak ɛ Bhɛzamɛ. Lii yam ɛ́ ebhele, mɛ ɛ́ dha bot ɛ mbyak ebhele. Mɛ nadi eduwal etsi eYuda dáa tɛtɛ Falizyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ zii dhaa tyɛ, é sok mɛ nadi etiig bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ. Dum nɛ tsik epiki nakwyalaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ, mɛ nadi ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Tin, sa mɛ nadi ebee náá, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nam ɛ, mɛ kabee yɛ mos é mis ɛ́ toto kɔ ɛsu ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Esa djas mɛ nazesa ɛ, mɛ kabee yɛ é mis ɛ́ toto, kɔ ɛsu ɛ sa di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ dhaa esonok djas ɛ. Sa tak ɛ́ ɛgu ɛ Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'am. Dum nɛ nɛ, mɛ eezekat dhiiti esonok djas. Étɛp ɛdi ɛ́ sama nɛ Klisto, mɛ kabee esonok binek djas ɛ́ dáa eput esonok di egoka nɛ ɛmwasaa kɔ ɛkwyiid ɛ, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />étɛp mɛ needi sama nɛ nɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Mɛ ààkakwyɛɛg nyel'am met, mɛ tokapɛ mot epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛduwal ɛ́ etsi. Mɛ ɛ́ mot epiki, etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛpedum koŋ nɛ Klisto. Mbi yenek epiki dus ɛ́ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ ɛ́ di esa náá, mot di piki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Sa djas mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ náá, mɛ gu Klisto, dɔɔ nɛ mɛbwala mɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ bhis ɛsyee, yɛ ɛ́ náá, mɛ zuk dáa nyɛy, da mɛ ɛ́ gwyɛ dáa nyɛy. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mam pe ɛ́ waagomelaa pak myoŋ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɛtɛ mɛpek mɛ ɛsum kaab étɛp ɛbela efute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Mɛ ààpake náá, mɛ eezebela efute ee mɛ di esaŋ ɛ, nɛghu mɛ ɛ́ mot zesa mɛsa djas di egoka náá, mɛ sa ɛ. Tin, mɛ dinaa tɔ ɛsum ɛ́ kaab étɛp ɛbela efute, etɛɛ náá, Yezu Klisto eezebela mɛ, wa mɛ tɔ ze yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Ààbɛ, bɔn-nyɛɛg, mɛ ààbee náá, mɛ eezebela efute tak. Tin, mɛ zosa ɛ́ sa wat, mɛ kagwyák ɛ́ pɛ sok, mɛ ààkagwyák pɛ bhis koŋ'am. É di'enek, mɛ dyeebasa mɛghaaz ɛ́ étɛp ɛdu etɛp di pɛ sok ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Deenek, mɛ dyeebasum kaab ɛ́, étɛp mɛ neebela efute ee Zɛɛb nakwom mɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ sa Yezu Klisto nasa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Menabɛlka djas bot ɛ di náá, mena eezepyetka tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsiiza deenek. Tin, bi ɛ kabaadi nɛ dhiiti egeka sis ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waalyaal dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Ye nakoozodi dáa, djhoogheeduka ze Zɛɛb nalyaal mena ɛ, yii bot di boozezyɛ nɛ ɛdu dɔɔ nɛ mos ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, biyɔ djas, baŋaka mɛfulu mam. Baŋaka mɛfulu mɛ bot ɛ di ebaŋa mɛfulu mes ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Mɛ nɛ dyeebalɛɛ bin yɛ ngwyis. Nenak yak, mɛ ɛpebaabasal nɛ meŋal é mis náá: Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ di ekɛ dáa bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɛ mezuk ɛ Klisto kɔ mɛlaaba ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Bɛ waaboowo ze, etɛɛ náá, yɔbɔ zɛɛb ɛ́ emɔ bɔɔ. É di'enek, bɛ nɛ myaala nɛ esa e sen bɛ di esa ɛ. Tɔ esiiza bɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ esa e bɔs. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka ɔɔ, menaka ɛ́ bot ɛ gwoo. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, mena dika ebhwood Mɛtsik-bot'enaka, Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Deenek, nyɛ waaswoola mena mbee nyel ee bot dika nɛ yɛ'aak, étɛp ye neenɔŋel nɛ nyel'ɛ di nɛ duma ɛ. Tin, nyɛ aasa yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil di esa náá, esonok djas di si eghɛŋ bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo nɛ mɛtiŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, biyɔ bot ɛ mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛbaabee ɔ, biyɔ ɛ́ di esa náá, bum lyem'am di tɔ mɛmyaala, biyɔ ɛ́ di kɔtɔ duu yam. Deenek, bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, dika sosoob tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Ghɛŋ.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Wɔy Evodhi nɛ wɔy Sɛɛtis, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nen, dika tɔ ɛgwakel pak'en sama nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Dɔɔ nɛ wɔy, mot di sosoob tɔ ɛsa mɛsa lɔɔg wat nɛ nam ɔ, mɛ ɛpewaab nɛ nɔ náá, wɔ kwyee boa bɛbá binɔk. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ naadyeebasa mɛghaaz mɛ ɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ Kelemɔ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa, yii min mɔɔ di tɔ mɛkana mɛ tsik ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Dika tɔ mɛmyaala é mɛwala djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Ghɛŋ. Mɛ ɛpebaabasal, dika nɛ mɛmyaala! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Beta náá, bot bee enɛm esa bin, etɛɛ náá, ɛbula ɛ Ghɛŋ eezekunaa. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Nàbemka ba nɛ dhiiti sonok, ye nakoozodi dáa. É mɛwala djas, waabka nɛ Zɛɛb esonok djas bi di nɛ gwyes nɛ yɛ ɛ tɔ mendjaala. Saka yɛ nɛ lyem duu tɔ ɛbulal ɛ́ bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Beta náá, egwyem e Zɛɛb di edhaa etsoŋ djas ɛ, baal elyem bin nɛ ɛbaal esiiza bin tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Deenek, bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, waka lyem tɔ sa djas di enyɔ ɛ, nɛ sa djas di egoka nɛ ɛkwyɛlaa ɛ. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwa lyem tɔ sa djas di tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ, sa di egoka nɛ duu ɛ, sa djas di piki ɛ, sa djas di dɛɛ ɛ. Deenek, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwa esiiza bin tɔ esa djas di egoka nɛ ɛduwalaa nɛghu ɛwaaa lyem ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Esa djas bi nadjek nɛ nam ɛ, nɛ esa djas bi nagwak nɛ nam, zɛnɔɔ esa djas bi nabee mɛ esa ɛ, waka yɛ tɔ mɛsa. Tɔ etɛp binek djas, Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ egwyem ɔ, nyɛ aadi nɛ nen sama.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpeghaapɛɛ bot ɛ ghaada Filip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Mɛ dyeebagwak mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bi eelyaal mɛ lyaala sis kwyɛl bi di nɛ yɛ nɛ nam ɛ. Mɛ ààpake deenek, etɛɛ náá, bi ààkataala mɛ. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ náá, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela mɔɔ ɛpɛɛd ɛ ɛwala étɛp ɛlyaal mɛ kwyɛl tak. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Tin, mɛ ààlii deenek etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ tɔ ɛsɛɛga. Bela náá, mɛ naadjek dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛmyaala nɛ sa nyɛ zodi nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Mɛ nɛ gu dáa mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdi tɔ edjel nɛghu tɔ mɛnyɔ ɛ. Mɛ naadjek mɛpek mɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛmyaala é mɛwala djas ye nakoozodi náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ za nɛghu mɛ ɛ́ nɛ djil. Ye nakoozodi náá, mɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛvu nɛghu tɔ ɛsɛɛga. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Tin, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa esa binek djas, etɛɛ náá, Klisto ɛpedjɛ mɛghwyil. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Deenek, bi naasa ɛnyɔɛpe é sok bi nadi egek mɛ ghoŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mezuk mam ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Biyɔ bot ɛ ghaada Filip, bi nɛ gu biyɔ bɛmet náá, é ghɛŋ mɛ nadus kɔ ghaada Masedwan ɛ, é sok mɛ nakan ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ sim zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ wat nakwyee mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />É sok mɛ nadi tɔ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi naadhis mɛ esonok djas mɛ nadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ye tok náá, mɛ saŋ ɛ náá, bi gheedhis mɛ mɛtom. Tin, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb sa bin enɛm kɔ ɛsu ɛ sa bi nadjɛ mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Mɛ naabela esa djas yii bi nadhis mɛ yɛ ɛ, ye nadi ɛ́ ɛbuɛpe kɛdhaa. Mɛ naazebela yɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ Epafolodhit, mɛ tokapɛ nɛ gwyes dhiiti sonok. Tin, esa ee bi dhis mɛ yɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ dáa ɛtom na mbɛɛ mɛnuub, yɛ ɛ́ buwa Zɛɛb di emyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ, buwa nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Zɛɛb'am ɛ́ waadjɛ bin esa djas yii bi aadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ, dum nɛ duma mɛvu mɛ nyɛ di nɛ yɛ, tɔ ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Beta náá, duu di nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Swoska bot djas di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto. Bɔn-nyɛɛg bin, bot ɛ bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ di ɔ, bɛ eeswos bin. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Bot djas zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ eeswos bin, daŋ-daŋ ɛ́ bot ɛ́ di esa mɛsa tɔ ndjaa boo mɛkoozi Sezaad ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Betka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto di tɔ esisim bin!<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>